Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:44:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/37] AOSCOS: Revert "kcms/touchpad: Drop X11 backend"

Upstream-Id: 2ac04a2463b4604a1c67b907033215edb1d00ce2

Restore backend selection, the X11 implementation and startup initialization
around the current touchpad KCM layout. Reintroduce the backend build
directory and generated options header removed by subsequent upstream
refactoring.

